# Claude Code agent runtime state and isolation worktrees. Parallel agent
# worktrees live under .claude/worktrees/<id>/ and carry copies of canonical
# templates; keeping .claude/ untracked stops `git add .` from staging those
# copies and injecting false Check Gate findings (issue #272).
.claude/
